; fas9_extents_visibility.scr - facit of which entities count in $EXTMIN/$EXTMAX. Run it with
;   python -I tools/fas9_facit_run.py doc/facit/fas9_extents_visibility.scr --input test/data/synthetic/extents_visibility.dxf
; Every case stands on its own extreme, so the saved header says what AutoCAD counted:
;   X max 1000     an invisible LINE in the model
;   Y max 2000     an invisible LINE in a block of an INSERT turned 0 degrees
;   Z max 3000     an invisible INSERT
;   Z min -7000    an invisible LINE in a block of an INSERT turned 30 degrees
;   X min -4000    an ATTRIB with group 60
;   Y min -5000    an ATTRIB with the invisible flag of group 70
;   Z max 10       a constant ATTDEF in a block
;   Z min -6000    a constant ATTDEF with the invisible flag
;   paper X max 500  an invisible LINE in paper space
_.REGEN
_.ZOOM
_E
_.TILEMODE
0
_.ZOOM
_E
_.TILEMODE
1
_.ZOOM
_E
;SAVE extents_visibility
;EXPECT INSERT ATTRIB LINE
